rofd (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Stamp annotation seal rendering, essential reading tools in the Qt
    reader, and broad ofdrw compatibility fixes: lenient parsing of
    non-conforming documents, the S path operator, BMP/GIF/TIFF/JBIG2
    image resources, and graceful handling of missing or undecodable
    media files.

 -- HualetWang <hualet@hualet.org>  Tue, 08 Sep 2026 23:24:30 +0800

rofd (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging, shipping the Qt6/QML reader application
    together with the rofd-ffi shared library and its C development
    files.

